      <bibitem*|2><label|bib-bailleulPhiMeasuresCompact2023>I.<nbsp>Bailleul,
      N.<nbsp>V. Dang, L.<nbsp>Ferdinand, and T.<nbsp>D. Tô.
      <newblock><math|\<Phi\><rsup|4><rsub|3>> measures on compact Riemannian
      <math|3>-manifolds. <newblock><with|font-shape|italic|arXiv:2304.10185>,
